  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The given quantity is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p>The percentage error for a quantity can be given by the formula&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math>.</p><p>Relation of the relative errors will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mi>P</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><mi>b</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mi>c</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, the percentage error is calculated by substituting the values,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mi>P</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>%</mo></math>.</p></blockquote>",
